  m_Name: TradeCoachingInn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: TradeCoachingInn
  displayName: Coaching Inn
  description: 'A timber-framed inn with a swinging sign and a coach house. Runs
    wagon trains on 2 routes. Build one in each of two towns (a town has housing
    or a town centre) and a trade route opens between them; caravans then go to and
    fro, and every trip brings coin and goods: more for long routes between big towns,
    and more on roads. Outposts the route passes produce more. Raiders attack caravans
    on the road.'
